  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Disaster Resilience in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to build resilience in communities and households in Pakistan to manage the impact of disasters by maintaining or transforming living standards in the face of shocks and stresses without compromising their long-term prospects.</narrative>
  </description>
